00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:00.060
And in the Sea Emperor's container lies the Sea Emperor bay-bies

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.540
And in the Sea Emperor bay-bies lie--

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.000
I gotta drink my piss here.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:04.580
(mumbling) Hang on, one second.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.960
(Slurps)

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:07.120
Slurp. Slurpy derp.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.100
