00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.120
Crack 'em open, like a... like a lobster

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:24.660
and slurp out the sweet delicious cure from their delicious innards.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:28.500
That or we need to like, pet 'em and wait for them to poop and then eat their poop.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.580
Either one, I'm willing to take either

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:33.260
I'm not exactly picky right now because I'm about to die,

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:35.760
But, first and foremost, gotta go down there.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.620
And I guess we could hit this lifepod on the way down.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.760
