00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:45.760
Big ol' fi--Ah!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:48.280
(Varied yelling noises)

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.600
Hey, hey, hey, (laughs) no...I did, I missed you.

